Note: 'spawn→first' is fork-to-first-correlated-response, the only
handshake looprs waits on; the child is not asked to be warm, only to
answer. RSS/CPU are the kernel's own numbers read from /proc from
outside the child, per this repo's convention (`spikes/ram_e2e.py`).

